"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d0664822b9225dbe20e4563da7eaf2ef36b7aa96b8b10e57a4ca846754c0c46.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2454d29afc0af9930007604a258c405d546891d5e36e974af8e200577ce3d0a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"海原 エレナ","creatorId":"vndb:s125","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s125","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s125","name":"海原エレナ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34752","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c70579","characterName":"盛岡 雛子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c70579"},"originalCharacterName":"盛岡 雛子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She grew up in an ordinary family and has a normal personality. Although she is somewhat laid-back and marches to the beat of her own drum, her actions are filled with kindness and consideration. While she has a few quirks, the maternal warmth she radiates evokes the image of a mother that captivates Asato's heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from ScooP archived page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70579"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb2b3ccb94b2e51582813557bae2274e4e774f6488a0551d9d00560178ec2665.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c65fef7009990f47b9f439758b71d9684074c535932844a5ffd78e6cfaddb77d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"須本 綾奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1013","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1013","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1013","name":"嶋崎 はるか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34754","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c70580","characterName":"須加崎 瑠璃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c70580"},"originalCharacterName":"須加崎 瑠璃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Deep down, she is a sweet and cute girl, but she’s too shy to show it. She ended up this way by just going along with the crowd. As for her current gyaru look—much like other high school girls these days—she’s starting to get bored with her tanned skin and is thinking it’s about time to give it up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from ScooP archived page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70580"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d30aa4117aab0eb0ee3b38d46160a35e76bd0fbe714c8ee297c61f75cd89eac7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44b97edad65ed9534a35d940f7d39fd5c92be8034d7ff587aecd5a15300fe8cd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天馬 和音","creatorId":"vndb:s10907","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10907","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10907","name":"天馬和音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34758","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c70581","characterName":"高岡 紀代子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c70581"},"originalCharacterName":"高岡 紀代子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She recently lost her husband in an accident. She suffered burns on her left hand that left an unsightly scar, so she always wears gloves. Having lost her husband in the prime of her womanhood, she constantly feels physical loneliness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from ScooP archived page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70581"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdcca416464e868ed6a0723f4c5cf85f15b85e2577cadca8875e37ecb2ead515.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5aa866170d4a8eaa22e7108447c7b72aa71a3abed04e25e17132970de0647e0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北条 明日香","creatorId":"vndb:s1016","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1016","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1016","name":"北条 明日香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:34755","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c70582","characterName":"鹿島 葵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c70582"},"originalCharacterName":"鹿島 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her mother passed away from illness around the same time she first met Asato. Although she grew up alongside Asato until junior high, her father’s wishes led to her studying abroad, forcing them apart. She continued her education overseas, but her father died while she was in college. Upon returning to Japan, she took over the family business."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While bearing the immense pressure of running the company, she uses Asato as a tool to eliminate those plotting against her. She believes that only Asato—with whom she shares a bond forged in childhood—truly u